CAKE scheduler for dummynet, as a kernel module (dn_cake.ko), and a
dnctl(8) that can set its parameters. Used by the os-cake plugin.

The module is built for one FreeBSD release, the one of the OPNsense
series it was built on, and against one dummynet.ko, whose SHA256 it
records. os-cake does not load it on another release or with another
dummynet.ko.
